From 904b9af6050488e8f79353ed151e259b9da719f3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: shixuantong <sxt1001@qq.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 09:28:11 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Fix typos in variable names, macros, and log messages across
 src

- Rename PYHS_ADDR_HEX_STR_MAX_LEN to PHYS_ADDR_HEX_STR_MAX_LEN
  in sentry_msg_monitor
- Rename TC_RING_ONE_PRAMA_ERR to TC_RING_ONE_PARAM_ERR in tc_ring_one
- Rename Xalarm attribute timetamp to timestamp (xalarm_api, alarm,
  register_xalarm)
- Fix log/comment misspellings: hearbeat_interval, recieve, falied,
  tescase, abonrmal, ccnfig, xalam

Co-Authored-By: GLM-5.3
